{
  "esm": "2.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "TGradNamedSteps",
    "description": "Time companions (esm-jacobian-spec.md \u00a74.2): the time bands keep the chain through the observed that move with t as named steps. A scalar time-interpolation weight w = (t - t0)/dt - floor((t - t0)/dt); an array observed Tb[i,k] = (1 - w) T[1,i,k] + w T[2,i,k] blending two temperature records elementwise; a second-level rate kr[i,k] = A (P[i,k]/p0) exp(-Ea/Tb[i,k]) reading Tb; a state c[i,k] reading kr at its own cell, and a state s[i] reading kr through a contraction over the vertical index k (a boundary-layer mean, sum_k kr[i,k] dz[k] / H). The data-fed parameters P (in kr) and Em (in an emission blend Eb[i] = (1 - wd) Em[1,i] + wd Em[2,i] whose weight wd is a parameter) are held fixed: Eb does not move with t and gets no companion. The time bands read the companions _dt_kr (c, at its cell; s, under a contraction sum), whose definitions read _dt_Tb, whose definition reads _dt_w."
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "MET": {
      "kind": "grid",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "file:///met/{date:%Y%m%d}.nc"
      }
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
